  "description": "RECPIB crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H76 Dy6 N12 O25,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.344-4.626 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.01-158.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Dy6C64H92N12O29. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
